      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.63,
      "end_seconds": 4.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.37,
      "end_seconds": 11.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.59,
      "end_seconds": 14.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "It's a fever, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.55,
      "end_seconds": 19.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.91,
      "end_seconds": 24.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "It's been going on for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.53,
      "end_seconds": 28.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.7,
      "end_seconds": 41.18,
      "duration_seconds": 11.48,
      "text": "I'd say mild. And trouble passing urine, too. As for trouble passing urine, a six out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.43,
      "end_seconds": 53.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.55,
      "end_seconds": 58.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.12,
      "end_seconds": 62.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "and alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.55,
      "end_seconds": 65.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.03,
      "end_seconds": 68.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.07,
      "end_seconds": 73.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.7,
      "end_seconds": 76.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "what do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.88,
      "end_seconds": 82.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.52,
      "end_seconds": 89.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Any allergies to to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.53,
      "end_seconds": 93.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.93,
      "end_seconds": 98.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.16,
      "end_seconds": 104.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "It's Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.92,
      "end_seconds": 109.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "alright, anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.55,
      "end_seconds": 120.57,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for about a year now. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.56,
      "end_seconds": 124.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.34,
      "end_seconds": 127.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.23,
      "end_seconds": 142.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Did you get chest pain, recent fall or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.84,
      "end_seconds": 147.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.5,
      "end_seconds": 152.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.1,
      "end_seconds": 155.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.55,
      "end_seconds": 170.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.39,
      "end_seconds": 179.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.76,
      "end_seconds": 206.85,
      "duration_seconds": 11.09,
      "text": "Okay: temp 38.8 degrees, saturation 97 percent, pulse is 105 beats a minute, respiratory rate 21, blood pressure 118 over 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.9,
      "end_seconds": 210.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.07,
      "end_seconds": 213.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.03,
      "end_seconds": 217.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "let's move on to the examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.26,
      "end_seconds": 221.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "let me feel here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.35,
      "end_seconds": 245.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "your spine is extremely tender at one level and your leg strength is reduced"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.09,
      "end_seconds": 250.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Okay, that's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.88,
      "end_seconds": 290.52,
      "duration_seconds": 24.64,
      "text": "okay, so my impression is this: I don't have a clear answer today: a possible spinal infection pressing on the nerves is possible, and so is a slipped disc so, to recap quickly you've had a fever for about two weeks, mild, and no chest pain or weight loss"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.85,
      "end_seconds": 294.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Mm, uh, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.96,
      "end_seconds": 314.62,
      "duration_seconds": 18.66,
      "text": "I want an urgent MRI of the spine done, that's for possible epidural abscess. You are going to hospital now, this can cause permanent weakness. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.78,
      "end_seconds": 318.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.62,
      "end_seconds": 325.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "come back straight away. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.62,
      "end_seconds": 332.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "great, thank you for your help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.77,
